From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Opz Browser <opz@localhost>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 12:21:19 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Sidebar: hide the tab column until the pointer reaches the
 window edge

With opz.sidebar.autoHide on ("Show tab column only on hover" in the tab
and toolbar context menus), the vertical tab column leaves the layout and
the page takes the whole width. A strip at the window edge brings the
column out over the page; it hides again when the pointer leaves, unless a
popup opened from it is showing. Horizontal tabs, web app and popup windows
and fullscreen are not affected.
---
